        rdfs:comment                   "Silk ribbon, France, 1820-1870"@en , "Silk ribbon with a thick, strongly ribbed weave. The design is of leaves in green and purple on white, strongly reminiscent of the fern patterns in the same restricted colour range on Paisley shawls of this date. The ribbed selvedge is in white and purple."@en ;
